, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rmmp7G8X\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-T9ELB9jL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hRz6LQ1L\">抖音id</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-M0Yk6CjJ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-cRYXQZqO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hCS85Kaj\">behaviors</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-uBsD6glf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xf6oGn2J\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-xSOZ5yMc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fsXMRd4f\">抖音用户行为类型, 详见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-抖音用户行为类型】</a>允许值:<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"FOLLOWED_USER\"</code>,</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-iIglsUwd\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"COMMENTED_USE